      "writtenOn": "2025-07-24T21:55:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this `memcpy()` is incorrect (but harmless) and should be deleted. I believe the source buffer `cpi-\u003etd.mb.intrabc_hash_info.hash_value_buffer` is still uninitialized at this point, so we are just copying uninitialized bytes to the destination buffer.\n\nIf you agree with my analysis, I can remove this `memcpy()` call in a separate CL.",
