        "id": 3678645
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-25T01:07:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you\u0027re right. Looking at the context of the other variables surrounding this initialization, and how `prepare_enc_workers()` is called, I think the author meant to do a `memset()` instead. Maybe that\u0027s what we should do instead?",
      "parentUuid": "5243b3d2_244cc142",
      "revId": "2bfb5a146134b657c9f0045f82508be497622582",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
