      "message": "Thanks for the confirmation. We should not blindly zero-initialize a buffer. These two buffers are used within `av1_get_block_hash_value()`. (They could be local variables in `av1_get_block_hash_value()` if we don\u0027t mind allocating and freeing them repeatedly.) By inspection we see these two buffers don\u0027t need to be initialized.",
